  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Refining Aesthetic Details**\n\nI\'m now focusing on refining the visual style, targeting `src/index.css`. I\'m incorporating the font families `Plus Jakarta Sans` and `JetBrains Mono` and exploring custom scrollbar styling. A grid background pattern is also being added for depth, and I\'m pushing for a subtle, premium look to align with the database engineer dashboard aesthetic.\n\n\n"
