          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "          The database was designed for a comprehensive e-commerce enterprise architecture covering customer accounts, multi-channel contact methods, physical and geospatial address telemetry, catalog product taxonomy, inventory logistics, sales transactions, order financials, payment settlements, and multi-carrier courier fulfillment."
